<header class="mb-6">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Operator</h1>
  <p class="opacity-70">
    Every tool that runs the clinic — the rules, the process, the discovery,
    and the helper agent.
  </p>
</header>

<section class="mb-8">
  <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold">Rules &amp; process</h2>
  <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <a
      href="/operator/decisions/appointment.triage/editor"
      class="card bg-base-100 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md"
    >
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title">Decision table editor</h3>
        <p class="text-sm opacity-70">
          Edit and publish the triage table. A changed rule takes effect on
          the next booking — no deploy.
        </p>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a
      href="/operator/processes/appointment_visit/designer"
      class="card bg-base-100 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md"
    >
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title">Process designer</h3>
        <p class="text-sm opacity-70">
          Draw the visit process: triage, check-in, the consult, labs,
          discharge. Publish a new version of the graph.
        </p>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a href="/decisions" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title">Published rules</h3>
        <p class="text-sm opacity-70">
          Which version of each decision table and process is live, and what
          came before.
        </p>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a href="/processes" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title">Published processes</h3>
        <p class="text-sm opacity-70">The visit process definitions, versioned.</p>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a href="/worklist" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title">Timers &amp; escalations</h3>
        <p class="text-sm opacity-70">
          Escalation timers ride the tasks themselves — the four-hour lab
          wait shows as a due date here. The engine ships no separate
          trigger UI.
        </p>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mb-8">
  <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold">Work</h2>
  <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <a href="/operator/tasks" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title">My tasks</h3>
        <p class="text-sm opacity-70">
          The engine's own inbox for the acting clinician — claim, complete,
          delegate.
        </p>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a href="/worklist" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title">Worklist</h3>
        <p class="text-sm opacity-70">
          Every open task in one board, completed through the engine so the
          token advances.
        </p>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a href="/visits" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title">Visit processes</h3>
        <p class="text-sm opacity-70">
          Where each visit stands; open one's instance viewer for the token
          overlay on the graph.
        </p>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mb-8">
  <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold">Discovery &amp; insight</h2>
  <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <a href="/canvas" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title">Data model canvas</h3>
        <p class="text-sm opacity-70">
          The whole clinic as a navigable graph — domains, resources,
          relationships — with a surface one click from every node.
        </p>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a href="/clarity" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title">Clarity</h3>
        <p class="text-sm opacity-70">
          Deep introspection: the module graph, ER and policy diagrams,
          supply-chain and security reports. Dev routes only.
        </p>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a href="/evaluations" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title">Decision evidence</h3>
        <p class="text-sm opacity-70">
          Every rule evaluation, with the matched table rows — what the rule
          decided, and why.
        </p>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold">Helper agent</h2>
  <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <a href="/agent" class="card bg-base-100 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3 class="card-title">Ask &amp; compose</h3>
        <p class="text-sm opacity-70">
          Ask questions about the clinic's data, or ask for a new interface:
          the agent composes and verifies a surface on the fly and shows it
          beside the conversation. Works without an API key for browsing —
          composing needs one.
        </p>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
